# Prism child-facing terminfo (follow-up).
#
# Built from the common xterm-256color feature set so claimed classic paths
# (alt screen, DECSTBM, 256-color, mouse, keys) stay usable under apps that
# probe terminfo. Prismattyc forces TERM=prismattyc-256color and points TERMINFO at the
# bundled database so the entry is found without a system install.
#
# Compile (from repo root):
#   tic -x -o terminfo terminfo/prism-256color.src
#
# Truecolor remains via COLORTERM=truecolor (matrix F10), not a custom setaf.
prismattyc-256color|Prismattyc terminal with 256 colors,
	use=xterm-256color,
